        "created_at": "2016-02-12T03:26:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I started with penny sleeves and later switched to premium sleeves.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I found that with some use the penny sleeves got ... squish? I'm not quite sure how to describe it. They weren't exactly sticky or oily, but they kinda stuck together and didn't feel very comfortable.</p>",
